From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 17:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] clk: sunxi-ng: a733: Keep the MSI_LITE0 bus matrix gates
 running

GMAC0 with its syscon, DMAC0 and the crypto engine sit behind the
MSI_LITE0 bus bridge. Nothing in the device tree consumes the bridge's
AHB and MBUS gates, so clk_disable_unused() closes them, and every
register behind the bridge then reads as zero: the GMAC reports no
version and fails to attach its PHY.

Mark both gates critical, as is done for the MBUS gate of the storage
bridge.

Not covered: describing the bridge gates as parents of the bus gates
behind them, as is done for the AHB gate of the storage bridge.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; both gates are still
open after clk_disable_unused(), the GMAC reads version 0x2053 and
attaches its PHY, and dmatest on DMAC0 completes. Without this change
the GMAC registers read 0 and the PHY attach failed with -EINVAL.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
index cc2b229e2e6a..15ba7312e654 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
@@ -565,7 +565,7 @@ static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(ahb_serdes_clk, "ahb-serdes", ahb_hws,
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(ahb_usb_sys_clk, "ahb-usb-sys", ahb_hws,
 			  0x5c0, BIT(9), 0);
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(ahb_msi_lite0_clk, "ahb-msi-lite0", ahb_hws,
-			  0x5c0, BIT(16), 0);
+			  0x5c0, BIT(16), CLK_IS_CRITICAL);
 
 /* This gate controls access to the storage controller MMIO registers. */
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(ahb_store_clk, "ahb-store", ahb_hws,
@@ -595,7 +595,7 @@ static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(mbus_vid_in_clk, "mbus-vid-in", mbus_hws,
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(mbus_serdes_clk, "mbus-serdes", mbus_hws,
 			  0x5e0, BIT(28), 0);
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(mbus_msi_lite0_clk, "mbus-msi-lite0", mbus_hws,
-			  0x5e0, BIT(29), 0);
+			  0x5e0, BIT(29), CLK_IS_CRITICAL);
 
 /* Keep enabled for the storage controller DMA paths. */
 static SUNXI_CCU_GATE_HWS(mbus_store_clk, "mbus-store", mbus_hws,
